"true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><p class="caption-note">Reference imagery from Michigan Custom Signs, shown as signage examples.</p></section><section class="soft-section"><div class="wrap story-grid"><figure class="project-image "><img src="/nyc/assets/mcs-new-hero-image-960.webp" srcset="/nyc/assets/mcs-new-hero-image-480.webp 480w, /nyc/assets/mcs-new-hero-image-960.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Dimensional lobby sign example" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Illustrative sign example · Michigan Custom Signs source</figcaption></figure><div><p class="eyebrow">A LOCAL CONVERSATION. BROADER CAPABILITIES.</p><h2>Built around your business.</h2><p>A new storefront. A more welcoming office. A coordinated brand across several locations. Vision Graphics brings design and production capabilities together around your project.</p><p>Share the space, the goal and the details that matter. The VG team can help develop an appropriate scope, artwork approach and production plan. Delivery and installation arrangements are confirmed for each project.</p><a class="btn dark" href="/nyc/about/">About Vision Graphics <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">BUILT AROUND YOUR BUSINESS</p><h2>What’s next for your space?</h2><div class="application-grid"><a class="application-card" href="/nyc/restaurants/"><h3>Restaurants, cafés &amp; bodegas</h3><p>A more visible storefront. Clear menus. A welcome that feels like you.</p><span>Explore ideas <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="application-card" href="/nyc/retail/"><h3>Retail &amp; local services</h3><p>Window campaigns, seasonal displays and graphics that guide the visit.</p><span>Explore ideas <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="application-card" href="/nyc/offices-properties/"><h3>Offices &amp; properties</h3><p>Lobby identity, privacy film and a clearer path through your building.</p><span>Explore ideas <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></section><section class="wrap priority-products"><h2>Start with your project</h2><div><a href="/nyc/window-graphics/">Window graphics<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a href="/nyc/storefront-signs/">Storefront signs<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a href="/nyc/lobby-signs/">Lobby signs<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a href="/nyc/office-signs/">Office signs<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class="wrap local-band"><div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="25" height="25" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg><h2>New York, one project at a time.</h2></div><a href="/nyc/brooklyn/">Brooklyn <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a href="/nyc/manhattan/">Manhattan <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></section><section class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM FIRST IDEA TO FINAL DETAILS</p><h2>A clear path forward.</h2></div></div><div class="steps"><div><span>01</span><h3>Show us the space</h3><p>Send photos, dimensions, your ZIP and what you want to achieve.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Define the project</h3><p>Discuss materials, artwork, site conditions and approval requirements.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Review the plan</h3><p>Confirm the proof, scope, schedule, delivery and any installation arrangements.</p></div></div></section><section class="wrap section portfolio-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM THE VISION GRAPHICS PORTFOLIO</p><h2>Real work. Useful ideas.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/nyc/projects/">Explore VG projects <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div><p class="portfolio-intro">Examples of VG’s broader work. The photographed locations are not specified in the original stories; these are not presented as New York installations.</p><div class="portfolio-grid"><a class="portfolio-card" href="/nyc/projects/big-d-construction/"><img src="/nyc/assets/vg-project-big-d-construction.webp" alt="Large Big-D Construction banner displayed on an unfinished commercial building" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"><div><p class="eyebrow">Big-D Construction</p><h3>Brand consistency from office to job site</h3><p>Construction site signage · Fleet graphics · Environmental office graphics</p><span>View the project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class="portfolio-card" href="/nyc/projects/cafe-rio/"><img src="/nyc/assets/vg-project-cafe-rio.webp" alt="Café Rio branded delivery vans parked together outside a Vision Graphics facility" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy"><div><p class="eyebrow">Café Rio</p><h3>Coordinated graphics across locations</h3><p>Interior graphics packages · Digital displays · Delivery van and fleet graphics</p><span>View the project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></div></a><a class="portfolio-card" href="/nyc/projects/eos-fitness/"><img src="/nyc/assets/vg-project-eos-fitness.jpg" alt="EōS Fitness wall mural with a landscape background above gym equipment" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy"><div><p class="eyebrow">EōS Fitness</p><h3>Branded spaces for a growing fitness business</h3><p>Environmental and facility graphics · Digital displays · Multi-location campaign graphics</p><span>View the project <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></div></a></div></section><section class="cta-band wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">START WITH YOUR SPACE</p><h2>A photo is a great place to start.</h2><p>Send your idea, approximate dimensions and project ZIP. We’ll use them to shape the conversation.</p></div><a class="btn primary" href="/nyc/contact/?photo=1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-camera" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.997 4a2 2 0 0 1 1.76 1.05l.486.9A2 2 0 0 0 18.003 